n synapse formation in cone photoreceptor cells (By similarity). May play a role in the regulation of tight junction formation (PubMed:19706687). Binds phosphatidylinositol 3,4-bisphosphate (PtdIns(3,4)P2) (PubMed:19706687). May play a role in the regulation of NOD2-mediated NF-kappa-B activation in immune response (PubMed:23213202)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}